{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-10","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：平面与平行线与角","englishTitle":"If two straight lines meeting one another be parallel to two straight lines meeting one another not in the same plane, they will contain equal angles.","book":11,"number":10,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.10","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.10/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":10,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-10@raw-51a89a02d80b989d","contentId":"euclid-11-10","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"51a89a02d80b989d05df6a9c5a4cc38d75db85e2d580076f2b75b25b5aca8f93","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-10.statement","euclid-11-10.construction.1","euclid-11-10.construction.2","euclid-11-10.proof.1","euclid-11-10.proof.2","euclid-11-10.proof.3","euclid-11-10.proof.4","euclid-11-10.proof.5","euclid-11-10.proof.6","euclid-11-10.conclusion","euclid-11-10.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-10.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-10","revisionId":"euclid-11-10@raw-51a89a02d80b989d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f0a65cd6fdc30645804c2b86a64dd20c10a0bb2bc30d9092bfb8e3045ed30662","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two straight lines meeting one another be parallel to two straight lines meeting one another not in the same plane, they will contain equal angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条直线相互相交, 与两条直线平行, 而不是在同一平面, 它们将包含相同的角度 。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-10.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-10","revisionId":"euclid-11-10@raw-51a89a02d80b989d","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e03d4500d89cca6e75ba5260bf27816c909f303e40c13377b16c90d529ac119","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two straight lines AB, BC meeting one another be parallel to the two straight lines DE, EF meeting one another, not in the same plane; I say that the angle ABC is equal to the angle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,BC两条直线相互相交,与DE,EF直线平行,而不是同一平面;我说,ABC角等于DEF角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-10.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-10","revisionId":"euclid-11-10@raw-51a89a02d80b989d","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4bbc71a67473d242c78fe37f72132cae692725ea1df6068d0b4fa9b97a14f3bf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BA, BC, ED, EF be cut off equal to one another, and let AD, CF, BE, AC, DF be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA,BC,ED,EF, 等量切断,AD,CF,BE,AC,DF连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-10.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-10","revisionId":"euclid-11-10@raw-51a89a02d80b989d","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c948329a766c8e58147a6240303c27c46ec3f7a41aba8dd0d57d5239d83bc215","citations":["euclid-1-33"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since BA is equal and parallel to ED, therefore AD is also equal and parallel to BE. [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,BA是相等的,平行的ED, 所以AD也是相等的,平行的BE。 [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-10.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-10","revisionId":"euclid-11-10@raw-51a89a02d80b989d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d79ce56c7b2c7dc6fd08238200ec4fecdc0a4dd8c4da4623451ead61a642c9a5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason CF is also equal and parallel to BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,CF也等于BE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-10.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-10","revisionId":"euclid-11-10@raw-51a89a02d80b989d","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2682f9e3b0cc0285543af1053d2ec55367d2e3a58fcc130be1413469df6c8e8e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the straight lines AD, CF is equal and parallel to BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AD、CF直线的每条线均等于BE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-10.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-10","revisionId":"euclid-11-10@raw-51a89a02d80b989d","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b6e1ab306e9d665f2f474ba69969490b65068f64651c583063af70eab6bfd39","citations":["euclid-11-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But straight lines which are parallel to the same straight line and are not in the same plane with it are parallel to one another; [[XI. 9](/principles/euclid-11-9)] therefore AD is parallel and equal to CF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但与同一直线平行的直线和不在同一平面直线之间是平行的;因此,AD直线是平行的,等于CF直线。 [[XI. 9](/principles/euclid-11-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-10.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-10","revisionId":"euclid-11-10@raw-51a89a02d80b989d","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c86fd7d56ebb5b7e5ba927c1de84895617a2337e63e640504f96530d5500389e","citations":["euclid-1-33"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And AC, DF join them; therefore AC is also equal and parallel to DF. [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC,DF连接它们, 因此AC也是相等的, 平行的DF。 [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-10.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-10","revisionId":"euclid-11-10@raw-51a89a02d80b989d","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4d0a81baf79c358345d832fbb1086905b2a0dd603512ce09bc1e56e8feb440a5","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the two sides AB, BC are equal to the two sides DE, EF, and the base AC is equal to the base DF, therefore the angle ABC is equal to the angle DEF. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,既然双方AB,BC等于双方DE,EF,底边,AC等于底边,DF,因此,角度ABC等于角度DEF。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-10.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-10","revisionId":"euclid-11-10@raw-51a89a02d80b989d","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-10.source","contentId":"euclid-11-10","revisionId":"euclid-11-10@raw-51a89a02d80b989d","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"087421dbd07404207eda8e1da0851b42ee094391a19b71ae122d9dbd5cc165a7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.10/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.10\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-10:euclid-1-33:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-10.proof.1","euclid-11-10.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-33","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"I. 33"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-10:euclid-11-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-10.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"XI. 9"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-10:euclid-1-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-10.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"I. 